# hyprpad-osk prediction model — TINY TEST FIXTURE.
#
# The committed input the test suite builds `fixture.model` from, so no test
# ever needs the multi-gigabyte data pipeline (osk/tools/build-model/). It is
# the same format the real pipeline emits: a word and its unigram probability,
# then its successors indented, each with S(successor | word).
#
# Hand-authored: ~130 common English words with approximate frequencies plus the
# handful the predictor's tests name, and a small set of plausible bigrams. The
# numbers are illustrative, not measured — this file exists to pin the FORMAT
# and the RANKING RULES, not to predict English.
#
# Rebuild the model from it with:
#   cargo run --bin hyprpad-osk-build-model -- data/fixture.words data/fixture.model
